  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=25>Goal</size>\nFind the SPELL/word of the day with the <i>least</i>
    amount of STRAIN.\nGuess it by typing small SPELLS/letters it into the WORD SPELLER.\n\n<size=25>Strain</size>\nSTRAIN
    is the cost of your actions:\n  1  - Revealing any cell\n 30 - Guessing wrong\n
    80 - Revealing a HEXED SPELL/letter\n\n<size=25>Hexes</size>\nDaily SPELL/word
    is made out of HEXED SPELLS/letters. A HEXED SPELL/letter is what you NEVER want
    to reveal (a great curse will befall onto you, and you will gain STRAIN of course).\n\n<size=25>Word
    Speller</size>\nThe WORD SPELLER has slots for SPELLS/letters. Input them by
    typing. Remove them using [ BACKSPACE ].\nThe target word <i>always</i> fits,
    locked slots are never opened.\n\n<size=25>Spell Chart</size>\nThe SPELL CHART
    shows you SPELL/letter overview:\n Striked - NOT Included\n Inverted- Included\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
